(4864120, 706401, 94614, '<td valign="top">Great shot- very spiritual- AMAZING colors! Added to my favorites</td>', 'Great shot- very spiritual- AMAZING colors! Added to my favorites', '2008-08-04 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864127, 706276, 94614, '<td valign="top">8 WOW! amazing shot- very beautiful lighting, editing- looks like a little bit of the model''s real(not curled) hair got free near the base of the neck- but it would just be nitpicking to mark you down for that on such a great shot!  Almost didn''t notice the dark wings on my first run through the pictures- nice added touch.</td>', '8 WOW! amazing shot- very beautiful lighting, editing- looks like a little bit of the model''s real(not curled) hair got free near the base of the neck- but it would just be nitpicking to mark you down for that on such a great shot!  Almost didn''t notice the dark wings on my first run through the pictures- nice added touch.', '2008-08-04 14:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864239, 705725, 55956, '<td valign="top">mmmm the angel don''t fly, the angel don''t fall.... is this the backstage or the photo? an interesting interpretation of the fallen angel before the fall :) A good photo that really I like, good use of the black and white, it add something to the image. good the  composition and the the pose of the models. I want be an incurable perfectionist(on the photos of the others :) ), the more grey on the right-top side of the angel would have cloned out(I don''t know if this is right but as personal opinion that point,is only a point, I would have cloned out). very good the sharpness and the details are very visible. an excellent work. 10</td>', 'mmmm the angel don''t fly, the angel don''t fall.... is this the backstage or the photo? an interesting interpretation of the fallen angel before the fall :) A good photo that really I like, good use of the black and white, it add something to the image. good the  composition and the the pose of the models. I want be an incurable perfectionist(on the photos of the others :) ), the more grey on the right-top side of the angel would have cloned out(I don''t know if this is right but as personal opinion that point,is only a point, I would have cloned out). very good the sharpness and the details are very visible. an excellent work. 10', '2008-08-04 15:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4864242, 706456, 55956, '<td valign="top">poor childrens, what they don''t does for the glory of the parent :) 8</td>', 'poor childrens, what they don''t does for the glory of the parent :) 8', '2008-08-04 15:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
