(4871399, 706062, 29440, '<td valign="top">Nice childrens box race at a social event. I would have cropped it a bit closer to eliminate some of the dead space on the right side and the top. To much distraction in the background. Their faces are in the shadows because their body shadows appear to be a late afternoon shot.  Maybe the shadow highlight enhance feature could have helped. I know how hard it is to get the correct lighting shot at a sporting event but you did a very good job with what you had to work with. 7</td>', 'Nice childrens box race at a social event. I would have cropped it a bit closer to eliminate some of the dead space on the right side and the top. To much distraction in the background. Their faces are in the shadows because their body shadows appear to be a late afternoon shot.  Maybe the shadow highlight enhance feature could have helped. I know how hard it is to get the correct lighting shot at a sporting event but you did a very good job with what you had to work with. 7', '2008-08-06 21:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871413, 706316, 29440, '<td valign="top">Good action shot. <br/>i little faster shutter speed if it was possible. Looks like an outdoor event and I know the lighting is a problem at sporting events. Rider appears to be heading for his fall.</td>', 'Good action shot. i little faster shutter speed if it was possible. Looks like an outdoor event and I know the lighting is a problem at sporting events. Rider appears to be heading for his fall.', '2008-08-06 21:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4871461, 706453, 84473, '<td valign="top">very nice action action shot! i assume u applied the high pass filter here because of the immediate shadows on the rider. it almost looked like it was pasted in the scene</td>', 'very nice action action shot! i assume u applied the high pass filter here because of the immediate shadows on the rider. it almost looked like it was pasted in the scene', '2008-08-06 21:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
