(4875476, 705747, 63269, '<td valign="top">beautiful scene.</td>', 'beautiful scene.', '2008-08-08 13:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875479, 706375, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat use of selective desat! I personally would have wanted to darken the desaturated portions of the photo for a little extra pop. Black against color usually works better than grey against color. Just a thought. Also as a nitpick, that streak of blue in the upper left corner of the image is a little distracting. In any case this is a good image.</td>', 'Neat use of selective desat! I personally would have wanted to darken the desaturated portions of the photo for a little extra pop. Black against color usually works better than grey against color. Just a thought. Also as a nitpick, that streak of blue in the upper left corner of the image is a little distracting. In any case this is a good image.', '2008-08-08 14:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875480, 706459, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, and I like the detail on the veil.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, and I like the detail on the veil.', '2008-08-08 14:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875482, 706308, 63269, '<td valign="top">SPLENDID editing - I love this sort of style.</td>', 'SPLENDID editing - I love this sort of style.', '2008-08-08 14:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875483, 706380, 63269, '<td valign="top">Imo, this could use a stronger composition. Nice colors and details though!</td>', 'Imo, this could use a stronger composition. Nice colors and details though!', '2008-08-08 14:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875486, 704335, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the post-processing here. The soft, smooth colors and the liquid shallow DOF... <i>Gorgeous</i>!!</td>', 'I love the post-processing here. The soft, smooth colors and the liquid shallow DOF... Gorgeous!!', '2008-08-08 14:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875493, 704615, 63269, '<td valign="top">Imo the vignette is a little harsh - a smoother transition might have been nice. This looks nice in black and white though.</td>', 'Imo the vignette is a little harsh - a smoother transition might have been nice. This looks nice in black and white though.', '2008-08-08 14:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875500, 705861, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks a little harsh on this - there are sharp shadows on the flower. It looks as though this were taken outside. I''ve found that shooting in harsh sunlight often results in photos with really hight contrast... but if I wait for a overcast, cloudy day, the light is much softer and yields better photos.  Hope this helps! :)</td>', 'The lighting looks a little harsh on this - there are sharp shadows on the flower. It looks as though this were taken outside. I''ve found that shooting in harsh sunlight often results in photos with really hight contrast... but if I wait for a overcast, cloudy day, the light is much softer and yields better photos.  Hope this helps! :)', '2008-08-08 14:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875503, 706178, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition is superb, and helps tell the story.</td>', 'The composition is superb, and helps tell the story.', '2008-08-08 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875505, 705352, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and focus.</td>', 'Nice colors and focus.', '2008-08-08 14:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875506, 705380, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like how you flipped this upside-down, very clever! The editing is great too, and compliments the photo perfectly.</td>', 'I like how you flipped this upside-down, very clever! The editing is great too, and compliments the photo perfectly.', '2008-08-08 14:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875508, 706340, 63269, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors!</td>', 'Lovely colors!', '2008-08-08 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875510, 706464, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit over-sharpened and over-processed. I love the colors though!</td>', 'This looks a bit over-sharpened and over-processed. I love the colors though!', '2008-08-08 14:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875512, 706053, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little loose - I wonder how this might look if it were cropped a bit?</td>', 'The composition is a little loose - I wonder how this might look if it were cropped a bit?', '2008-08-08 14:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875521, 706406, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally do not care for this style of editing, but the concept here is just terrific! A very clever idea.</td>', 'I personally do not care for this style of editing, but the concept here is just terrific! A very clever idea.', '2008-08-08 14:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875565, 705309, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the sepia here and the contrast is just perfect!<br/> <br/>Reminded me of this :)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=607604" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/15711/120/607604.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/15711/120/607604.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/15711/120/607604.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love the sepia here and the contrast is just perfect! Reminded me of this :)', '2008-08-08 14:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875570, 706270, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the frame, but I''m not entirely sure if the frame and the tilt work together. Just a thought.</td>', 'I like the frame, but I''m not entirely sure if the frame and the tilt work together. Just a thought.', '2008-08-08 14:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875572, 706281, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.</td>', 'Very interesting.', '2008-08-08 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875598, 704436, 63269, '<td valign="top">On my screen, the image quality seems a bit poor... It seems a little grainy and over-saturated. But with that aside this is a very, very beautiful image. The tones and shadows are very rich, and the story this tells is powerful. Lovely capture!</td>', 'On my screen, the image quality seems a bit poor... It seems a little grainy and over-saturated. But with that aside this is a very, very beautiful image. The tones and shadows are very rich, and the story this tells is powerful. Lovely capture!', '2008-08-08 14:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875602, 705989, 63269, '<td valign="top">I personally think this might look nice if it were a little darker and/or had more contrast. I''m not sure how you took this shot though (long exposure?) and perhaps that would be to difficult to achieve.</td>', 'I personally think this might look nice if it were a little darker and/or had more contrast. I''m not sure how you took this shot though (long exposure?) and perhaps that would be to difficult to achieve.', '2008-08-08 14:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875608, 706316, 63269, '<td valign="top">Although I personally think this might be stretching it a bit to meet the challenge, I think the photo itself is terrific! I LOVE the motion blur, although I wouldn''t be surprised if the voters bomb you for that. I can''t ever recall seeing a blurry rodeo photo, which is probably part of why I like this so much. It''s unusual and different. The perfectly focused ones have gotten boring! ;)</td>', 'Although I personally think this might be stretching it a bit to meet the challenge, I think the photo itself is terrific! I LOVE the motion blur, although I wouldn''t be surprised if the voters bomb you for that. I can''t ever recall seeing a blurry rodeo photo, which is probably part of why I like this so much. It''s unusual and different. The perfectly focused ones have gotten boring! ;)', '2008-08-08 14:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875621, 705691, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m going to be honest - It doesn''t really look like a photo anymore to me, which is problematic in a photography contest. I do like how you executed the concept as well as the bright colors though.</td>', 'I''m going to be honest - It doesn''t really look like a photo anymore to me, which is problematic in a photography contest. I do like how you executed the concept as well as the bright colors though.', '2008-08-08 14:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875627, 705993, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice colors! I would suggest adding just a bit more contrast to make those beautiful colors really pop.</td>', 'Nice colors! I would suggest adding just a bit more contrast to make those beautiful colors really pop.', '2008-08-08 14:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875637, 706170, 63269, '<td valign="top">Usually I''m all for interesting angles, but in this photo the angle seems to have compromised the composition a little bit. Or perhaps it''s the cropping. I don''t know, but in any case, she almost appears to be sliding out of the photo. However, I LOVE the colors and the lighting''s lovely.</td>', 'Usually I''m all for interesting angles, but in this photo the angle seems to have compromised the composition a little bit. Or perhaps it''s the cropping. I don''t know, but in any case, she almost appears to be sliding out of the photo. However, I LOVE the colors and the lighting''s lovely.', '2008-08-08 14:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875638, 705991, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very clever concept!</td>', 'Very clever concept!', '2008-08-08 14:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875639, 706401, 63269, '<td valign="top">Exquisitely beautiful colors.</td>', 'Exquisitely beautiful colors.', '2008-08-08 14:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875651, 706434, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve already received dozens of comments saying this, but I suppose I''ll add my two cents as well: "the horizon''s tilted!." :) If that could be corrected, I think this photo would have an even stronger first-impression impact. Those curves, lines, and patterns all add up for a very impressive composition.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve already received dozens of comments saying this, but I suppose I''ll add my two cents as well: "the horizon''s tilted!." :) If that could be corrected, I think this photo would have an even stronger first-impression impact. Those curves, lines, and patterns all add up for a very impressive composition.', '2008-08-08 14:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875652, 706419, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors and neat use of shallow DOF.</td>', 'Nice bright colors and neat use of shallow DOF.', '2008-08-08 14:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875658, 706312, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little weak here, but this is beautiful nevertheless.</td>', 'The composition is a little weak here, but this is beautiful nevertheless.', '2008-08-08 14:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875672, 706313, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh now <i>that''s</i> funny!  :) I could complain that the focus is a little blurry, but it looks as though you didn''t have enough time to set everything up just perfectly, so I won''t. One thing I believe could be fixed though is the contrast/exposure. A little added contrast might make this pop a little more. This is just funny though. I think that somehow, part of what gives it so much humor is the fact that the "fallen" goose is, at first glance, in much the same pose as the other two. Almost as if he''s trying to pretend he hasn''t fallen or something... Awesome capture. :)</td>', 'Oh now that''s funny!  :) I could complain that the focus is a little blurry, but it looks as though you didn''t have enough time to set everything up just perfectly, so I won''t. One thing I believe could be fixed though is the contrast/exposure. A little added contrast might make this pop a little more. This is just funny though. I think that somehow, part of what gives it so much humor is the fact that the "fallen" goose is, at first glance, in much the same pose as the other two. Almost as if he''s trying to pretend he hasn''t fallen or something... Awesome capture. :)', '2008-08-08 15:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875677, 706451, 63269, '<td valign="top">The concept might not be very unusual, and imho it might be a bit of a stretch for meeting the challenge, but beautiful, beautiful, beautiful PERFECT lighting.</td>', 'The concept might not be very unusual, and imho it might be a bit of a stretch for meeting the challenge, but beautiful, beautiful, beautiful PERFECT lighting.', '2008-08-08 15:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875679, 705166, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the processing! Neat work.</td>', 'I love the processing! Neat work.', '2008-08-08 15:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875684, 706070, 63269, '<td valign="top">There are so many interesting things to study in this photo - all the different reflections, lights, patterns, shapes... and the people. They are placed just <i>perfectly</i>. I like how you''ve managed to make them seem very small and insignificant in comparison to their surroundings, and yet you can''t help but notice them. Overall, this has a <i>terrific</i> composition. Well done.</td>', 'There are so many interesting things to study in this photo - all the different reflections, lights, patterns, shapes... and the people. They are placed just perfectly. I like how you''ve managed to make them seem very small and insignificant in comparison to their surroundings, and yet you can''t help but notice them. Overall, this has a terrific composition. Well done.', '2008-08-08 15:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875685, 706347, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful post-processing!</td>', 'Beautiful post-processing!', '2008-08-08 15:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875688, 706463, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is just a bit too dark - some adjustments with contrast and brightness might give this photo more impact.</td>', 'This is just a bit too dark - some adjustments with contrast and brightness might give this photo more impact.', '2008-08-08 15:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875714, 703975, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot and very fun processing to match!</td>', 'Great shot and very fun processing to match!', '2008-08-08 15:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875715, 704335, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, how sad!  So delicate and lovely even in death.  The tones are perfect.  My favorite of this challenge.</td>', 'Oh, how sad!  So delicate and lovely even in death.  The tones are perfect.  My favorite of this challenge.', '2008-08-08 15:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875716, 706456, 30982, '<td valign="top">Priceless.</td>', 'Priceless.', '2008-08-08 15:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875717, 706464, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice processing and great warm tones.</td>', 'Nice processing and great warm tones.', '2008-08-08 15:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875720, 706299, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the bizareness!  Great title.</td>', 'Love the bizareness!  Great title.', '2008-08-08 15:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875721, 706316, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent action capture and I do like the way you used subtle selective desat to isolate your subject in what is always a busy background at these events.  Well done.</td>', 'Excellent action capture and I do like the way you used subtle selective desat to isolate your subject in what is always a busy background at these events.  Well done.', '2008-08-08 15:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875725, 704790, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not only is this a wonderful portrait, it''s a very creative and interesting take on the challenge!</td>', 'Not only is this a wonderful portrait, it''s a very creative and interesting take on the challenge!', '2008-08-08 15:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875726, 704780, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good idea and nicely executed!</td>', 'Very good idea and nicely executed!', '2008-08-08 15:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875729, 706388, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very creative and interesting interpretation and wonderful cool light - very much gives it a starlit feel.</td>', 'Very creative and interesting interpretation and wonderful cool light - very much gives it a starlit feel.', '2008-08-08 15:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875735, 705605, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Someone will complain about the cutoff hair, but I like the realism of her shirt falling and the composition works for me.</td>', 'Well done.  Someone will complain about the cutoff hair, but I like the realism of her shirt falling and the composition works for me.', '2008-08-08 15:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875737, 706334, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective and very nice architecture shot - I like the deep DOF.</td>', 'Very cool perspective and very nice architecture shot - I like the deep DOF.', '2008-08-08 15:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875738, 706326, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in color and textures.  Works very nicely here.</td>', 'I like the contrast in color and textures.  Works very nicely here.', '2008-08-08 15:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875739, 706460, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice interpretation of the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice interpretation of the challenge!', '2008-08-08 15:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875740, 706443, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors and light - perfect time of day to shoot this.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors and light - perfect time of day to shoot this.', '2008-08-08 15:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875741, 706070, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the challenge!  Great shot as well.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the challenge!  Great shot as well.', '2008-08-08 15:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875742, 704597, 30982, '<td valign="top">Marvelous portrait.  Excellent light, detail, composition.</td>', 'Marvelous portrait.  Excellent light, detail, composition.', '2008-08-08 15:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4875855, 705352, 811, '<td valign="top">too, too, too funny!</td>', 'too, too, too funny!', '2008-08-08 17:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
