(4876891, 705737, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure about the lighting. But I think it actually adds to the photo, because it gives the photo a very fitting mood - dreary and glum. Good shot.</td>', 'I''m really not sure about the lighting. But I think it actually adds to the photo, because it gives the photo a very fitting mood - dreary and glum. Good shot.', '2008-08-09 10:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876893, 706326, 63269, '<td valign="top">very interesting composition - good work!</td>', 'very interesting composition - good work!', '2008-08-09 10:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876903, 706076, 63269, '<td valign="top">Imo the angle and composition here isn''t very strong... but I know from experience that shooting trees (or any long skinny object, for that matter) is extremely difficult. Try experimenting unusual points of view and angles. Maybe try getting farther away from the tree as well, and see if that works.</td>', 'Imo the angle and composition here isn''t very strong... but I know from experience that shooting trees (or any long skinny object, for that matter) is extremely difficult. Try experimenting unusual points of view and angles. Maybe try getting farther away from the tree as well, and see if that works.', '2008-08-09 10:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876916, 706384, 63269, '<td valign="top">Oh. How. Beautiful. Exquisite. And something about the way you''ve placed the dress on the ground makes the viewer think of angles and <i>fallen</i>. You''ve met the challenge in the hardest way possible, in taking a subject that doesn''t necessarily have much to do with the challenge, but used your photography skills to create artistic impressions of  the challenge subject. Incredibly skillful work! Would not be surprised if this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=35804" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">RKT</a>''s. :)</td>', 'Oh. How. Beautiful. Exquisite. And something about the way you''ve placed the dress on the ground makes the viewer think of angles and fallen. You''ve met the challenge in the hardest way possible, in taking a subject that doesn''t necessarily have much to do with the challenge, but used your photography skills to create artistic impressions of  the challenge subject. Incredibly skillful work! Would not be surprised if this is  RKT''s. :)', '2008-08-09 10:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876920, 704790, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and focus</td>', 'Nice colors and focus', '2008-08-09 10:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876922, 706467, 63269, '<td valign="top">beautiful, LOVELY post-processing! Very nicely done. This whole image has an exquisite delicate mood, created in part I think by the feathery script of the tombstone.</td>', 'beautiful, LOVELY post-processing! Very nicely done. This whole image has an exquisite delicate mood, created in part I think by the feathery script of the tombstone.', '2008-08-09 10:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876925, 705816, 63269, '<td valign="top">IMO the composition is a little weak but the shallow DOF works great here. Clever concept!</td>', 'IMO the composition is a little weak but the shallow DOF works great here. Clever concept!', '2008-08-09 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876926, 705987, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2008-08-09 10:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876935, 706362, 63269, '<td valign="top">IMO the composition is kind of cluttered and confusing. My eyes aren''t sure were to rest. I think it might help if the man were in a different placing, and not cropped in half. Perhaps place him off to one side of the photo, and have him get a little closer to the camera, and place him at an angle where he is looking at the monument but you can see his face in the picture...  Just a thought.</td>', 'IMO the composition is kind of cluttered and confusing. My eyes aren''t sure were to rest. I think it might help if the man were in a different placing, and not cropped in half. Perhaps place him off to one side of the photo, and have him get a little closer to the camera, and place him at an angle where he is looking at the monument but you can see his face in the picture...  Just a thought.', '2008-08-09 10:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876939, 706443, 63269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and well-done. You chose the perfect time of day to do this in - the golden light catching the dew on the grass, and the fog in the distance is lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful and well-done. You chose the perfect time of day to do this in - the golden light catching the dew on the grass, and the fog in the distance is lovely.', '2008-08-09 10:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876940, 706376, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is just a thought, but I wonder how this might look if you could see more of the hand, and if that white strap on the bottom were out of the photo. It''s a little distracting. I like the concept here though - the details of the dirt and the wrinkles on the skin are awesome. It''s just that the composition is a little weak.</td>', 'This is just a thought, but I wonder how this might look if you could see more of the hand, and if that white strap on the bottom were out of the photo. It''s a little distracting. I like the concept here though - the details of the dirt and the wrinkles on the skin are awesome. It''s just that the composition is a little weak.', '2008-08-09 10:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876942, 706409, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very creative and interesting. That reflection of the flames in the glasses adds the perfect touch.</td>', 'Very creative and interesting. That reflection of the flames in the glasses adds the perfect touch.', '2008-08-09 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4876946, 705304, 63269, '<td valign="top">:)  The colors are sweet and shallow DOF beautiful.</td>', ':)  The colors are sweet and shallow DOF beautiful.', '2008-08-09 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
