(4879828, 706180, 89809, '<td valign="top">Hi Irene, congratz on the score!  I like this style a lot.  I''ve looked at some of your other shots and gathered that you did this on a glass table with a blue transparency over one flash from underneath, but how did you get the back to be glass too...?  Looks like a curved product table made of glass/mirror?  Or if you''ve already explained this in another shot, could you please point me to it?  Thanks very much!</td>', 'Hi Irene, congratz on the score!  I like this style a lot.  I''ve looked at some of your other shots and gathered that you did this on a glass table with a blue transparency over one flash from underneath, but how did you get the back to be glass too...?  Looks like a curved product table made of glass/mirror?  Or if you''ve already explained this in another shot, could you please point me to it?  Thanks very much!', '2008-08-11 04:19:12.000000', NULL, 0),
