(4880230, 706394, 27133, '<td valign="top">Oooooh...I give this a 7...I didn''t know his was yours....well done.</td>', 'Oooooh...I give this a 7...I didn''t know his was yours....well done.', '2008-08-11 09:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880232, 705990, 92296, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 4s.  Primarily because I''m not a big fan of pictures of statues.  To me it''s more or less the same as taking a picture of a painting or another photograph - unless you bring some ''added value'', the result relies on the quality of somebody else''s artwork.  In this case, I like the depth of field, but the background in conjunction with the main subject don''t offer much contrast.  A different perspective might have helped create a more interesting composition maybe?</td>', 'I was one of your 4s.  Primarily because I''m not a big fan of pictures of statues.  To me it''s more or less the same as taking a picture of a painting or another photograph - unless you bring some ''added value'', the result relies on the quality of somebody else''s artwork.  In this case, I like the depth of field, but the background in conjunction with the main subject don''t offer much contrast.  A different perspective might have helped create a more interesting composition maybe?', '2008-08-11 09:54:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880262, 705990, 30049, '<td valign="top">My guess is that it just didn''t connect with the voters pertaining to the challenge theme.  Personally I think it''s a nice photo, although it is a bit documentary and static (i.e. - no "Wow" factor).<br/> <br/>I like the inclusion of some foreground leaves and the positioning of the statue in the comp.  The exposure of the statue is on the mark, and I like that the processing didn''t make it harsh...instead it has a ethereal glow to it.</td>', 'My guess is that it just didn''t connect with the voters pertaining to the challenge theme.  Personally I think it''s a nice photo, although it is a bit documentary and static (i.e. - no "Wow" factor). I like the inclusion of some foreground leaves and the positioning of the statue in the comp.  The exposure of the statue is on the mark, and I like that the processing didn''t make it harsh...instead it has a ethereal glow to it.', '2008-08-11 10:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880303, 705990, 67258, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 5.  It is a competent photo of a peice of sculpture.  You have chosen a good angle, and the light is pleasing, but there was little that made me want to stay and explore the photo.  Whilst I could see, through your title, that there was a link to the challenge theme, to me it wasn''t strong, and I suspect that may also have subconsciously swayed my vote slightly.  I''m not sure that there was a high scoring photo in your subject.</td>', 'I gave you a 5.  It is a competent photo of a peice of sculpture.  You have chosen a good angle, and the light is pleasing, but there was little that made me want to stay and explore the photo.  Whilst I could see, through your title, that there was a link to the challenge theme, to me it wasn''t strong, and I suspect that may also have subconsciously swayed my vote slightly.  I''m not sure that there was a high scoring photo in your subject.', '2008-08-11 10:37:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880328, 705605, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Yayyyy!    This is fabulous!   FABULOUS!   Your talent is NEVER disappointing :)  CONGRATULATIONS!<br/></td>', 'Oh Yayyyy!    This is fabulous!   FABULOUS!   Your talent is NEVER disappointing :)  CONGRATULATIONS!', '2008-08-11 10:45:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880337, 703975, 24454, '<td valign="top">Lydia, this is so amazing!  I know I already told you -- but I LOVE this photo!  Congragulationson another top finisher!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Lydia, this is so amazing!  I know I already told you -- but I LOVE this photo!  Congragulationson another top finisher! ', '2008-08-11 10:46:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880339, 705990, 49954, '<td valign="top">I gave a 4 on this one.  Was slightly fuzzy.  While a unique take on the challenge, there was no indication who this "hero" was so I made no connection to him being "fallen".</td>', 'I gave a 4 on this one.  Was slightly fuzzy.  While a unique take on the challenge, there was no indication who this "hero" was so I made no connection to him being "fallen".', '2008-08-11 10:47:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880343, 706434, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is amazing!  I''m such a big fan of national cemetery photos.   There is something so gallant and noble about them.  There is a place at our national cemetery that has the hills and the look like this, but it doesn''t photograph well because there is to much "stuff" in the way.   This is so clean and flawlessly beautiful.  Congratulations on finishing on the front page.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, this is amazing!  I''m such a big fan of national cemetery photos.   There is something so gallant and noble about them.  There is a place at our national cemetery that has the hills and the look like this, but it doesn''t photograph well because there is to much "stuff" in the way.   This is so clean and flawlessly beautiful.  Congratulations on finishing on the front page. ', '2008-08-11 10:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880348, 706308, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love it when a photo does better than expected.   This is so well done.   You''re amazing, MAK!</td>', 'I love it when a photo does better than expected.   This is so well done.   You''re amazing, MAK!', '2008-08-11 10:49:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880352, 706339, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this photo so much!  The only thing I don''t love is that it is in 20th place rather than being in the top few!  It is awesome!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this photo so much!  The only thing I don''t love is that it is in 20th place rather than being in the top few!  It is awesome! ', '2008-08-11 10:50:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880362, 705990, 83313, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I can see some of why it cam in where it did. The first thing that struck me was that the composition is rather plain. A different perspective may have been what it needed in that area. The coloring of the statue has a greenish tint that keeps it from standing out from the background. A different white balance could help that aspect. Just my impression of what jumped out at me on first glance, hope that helps some.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I can see some of why it cam in where it did. The first thing that struck me was that the composition is rather plain. A different perspective may have been what it needed in that area. The coloring of the statue has a greenish tint that keeps it from standing out from the background. A different white balance could help that aspect. Just my impression of what jumped out at me on first glance, hope that helps some.', '2008-08-11 10:55:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880363, 705605, 90947, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot realized from an challenging concept.  You deserved the scores you got; at a minimum. <br/> <br/>I don''t really understand the setup you described.  Any chances you took a photo of that?  I would love to see it.<br/> <br/>In any case, superb work.</td>', 'Awesome shot realized from an challenging concept.  You deserved the scores you got; at a minimum.  I don''t really understand the setup you described.  Any chances you took a photo of that?  I would love to see it. In any case, superb work.', '2008-08-11 10:55:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880380, 706384, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf:</b></div><hr/><i> Shoehorned relevance I think. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry about not being <b><i>Master of the Obvious</i></b>...gimme a break, and yourself one too.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cutout:</b></div><hr/><i> why?    7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s for you to decide. Use your imagination.</td>', 'Originally posted by HawkeyeLonewolf: Shoehorned relevance I think.   Sorry about not being Master of the Obvious...gimme a break, and yourself one too. Originally posted by cutout: why?    7   That''s for you to decide. Use your imagination.', '2008-08-11 11:07:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880416, 706347, 6667, '<td valign="top">White on white is sooo hard to do. The front left is the neat part of your image.  The right is too blown out. Was wondering why you did not crop it out.</td>', 'White on white is sooo hard to do. The front left is the neat part of your image.  The right is too blown out. Was wondering why you did not crop it out.', '2008-08-11 11:29:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880432, 705990, 67697, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge but I probably would have given this a 5.  It''s a great shot of a statue but there''s nothing dynamic about it (kind of like mine lol).  I can understand how it relates to the challenge but I don''t feel any emotional pull with it.  I would need something else to make it more engaging to raise the voting score above 5.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge but I probably would have given this a 5.  It''s a great shot of a statue but there''s nothing dynamic about it (kind of like mine lol).  I can understand how it relates to the challenge but I don''t feel any emotional pull with it.  I would need something else to make it more engaging to raise the voting score above 5.', '2008-08-11 11:40:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880433, 706296, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of a place that is obviously in ruins.  Excellent job.  Congrats on the HM!!</td>', 'Beautiful capture of a place that is obviously in ruins.  Excellent job.  Congrats on the HM!!', '2008-08-11 11:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880439, 706334, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on 21st, Scott!  Love the shapes, point of view, and colors.</td>', 'Congrats on 21st, Scott!  Love the shapes, point of view, and colors.', '2008-08-11 11:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880450, 706456, 83026, '<td valign="top">The expressions ROFL ROFL ROFL AWESOME</td>', 'The expressions ROFL ROFL ROFL AWESOME', '2008-08-11 11:54:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880458, 705990, 10686, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...Well, it''s a statue and, as most statues are, it''s pretty stationary. As others have already commented, your photograph doesn''t really add anything to make this more than a simple document of what this statue looks like. <br/> <br/>As far as meeting the theme of the challenge, "Fallen", the statue''s standing. It may be a monument to fallen heroes, but that''s far from obvious. Now, if the statue were hit by a car and had fallen over, then it would fit or if the statue were of a soldier fallen in combat. But this guy''s standing, ready to stand his ground and fight.</td>', 'Hmmm...Well, it''s a statue and, as most statues are, it''s pretty stationary. As others have already commented, your photograph doesn''t really add anything to make this more than a simple document of what this statue looks like.  As far as meeting the theme of the challenge, "Fallen", the statue''s standing. It may be a monument to fallen heroes, but that''s far from obvious. Now, if the statue were hit by a car and had fallen over, then it would fit or if the statue were of a soldier fallen in combat. But this guy''s standing, ready to stand his ground and fight.', '2008-08-11 12:03:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880467, 703975, 66952, '<td valign="top">That smarts! Congrats on the top 10! Well deserved.</td>', 'That smarts! Congrats on the top 10! Well deserved.', '2008-08-11 12:06:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880478, 703975, 48228, '<td valign="top"><b>GOOD</b> result, <b>AWESOME</b> image here..... Totally <b>WILD.....</b></td>', 'GOOD result, AWESOME image here..... Totally WILD.....', '2008-08-11 12:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4880491, 705725, 85102, '<td valign="top">excellent contrast! love it!</td>', 'excellent contrast! love it!', '2008-08-11 12:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
