(4882487, 705264, 59029, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and concept, Rosemary, but I do agree with Peter and Deb about needing a greater sense of depth.  And you''re far from being the only one capable of tanking in terms of scores.  <br/> <br/>And hey, as Deb referenced the mighty ribbon-winning machine, IreneM...guess what?  Even she has a recent score in the 4s!<br/> <br/>Don''t get discouraged, just keep shooting! :-)</td>', 'Lovely composition and concept, Rosemary, but I do agree with Peter and Deb about needing a greater sense of depth.  And you''re far from being the only one capable of tanking in terms of scores.   And hey, as Deb referenced the mighty ribbon-winning machine, IreneM...guess what?  Even she has a recent score in the 4s! Don''t get discouraged, just keep shooting! :-)', '2008-08-12 08:19:47.000000', NULL, 0),
