(4884605, 706143, 60862, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, Deb.  I like the detail of the lake bottom up top and the color in the leaves.</td>', 'Very pretty, Deb.  I like the detail of the lake bottom up top and the color in the leaves.', '2008-08-13 02:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4885002, 706456, 28410, '<td valign="top">Great shot, captured the ride perfectly.</td>', 'Great shot, captured the ride perfectly.', '2008-08-13 06:41:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4885220, 706415, 67258, '<td valign="top">I haven''t ever seen a spotted lily like this - I love the way that it reminds me of a beetle, and then has a beetle riding on it! There is a pleasing hint of translucence to the petals, and I like the composition with the use of negative space.  When I was voting I remember thinking that the photo didn''t really communicate the concept of ''Fallen'' to me, although I can see from your notes why you chose the subject you did.</td>', 'I haven''t ever seen a spotted lily like this - I love the way that it reminds me of a beetle, and then has a beetle riding on it! There is a pleasing hint of translucence to the petals, and I like the composition with the use of negative space.  When I was voting I remember thinking that the photo didn''t really communicate the concept of ''Fallen'' to me, although I can see from your notes why you chose the subject you did.', '2008-08-13 08:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4885226, 706351, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is something desperately sad, but also strangely comforting in the scene that you have capture - and captured well.  It reminds me of the frailty of life, of how tenuous our grasp on it is, but also that that is the natural order of things,m and that life goes on.  A sympathetic photograph, with impact.</td>', 'There is something desperately sad, but also strangely comforting in the scene that you have capture - and captured well.  It reminds me of the frailty of life, of how tenuous our grasp on it is, but also that that is the natural order of things,m and that life goes on.  A sympathetic photograph, with impact.', '2008-08-13 08:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4885238, 706366, 67258, '<td valign="top">A lovely and simple title for a pleasingly presented and simple photograph, the one fitting the other well.  As <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=90658" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tootsweet</a> has mentioned, the condensation on the bottle is wonderful, and I feel adds an aura to the image that is so evocative of my idealised sense of homeliness.  On a technical note, I wonder if the composition would be bettered by moving the bottle slightly to the right - the flowers lean to the left, and this may make more of that feature.  I am also slightly unsure about the focus - on the green stems and leaves it is as I like it, detailed but not over sharp, but on the flower heads it does seem a little lacking in definition. A pleasing photo that I had expected to see in the top half of scores.</td>', 'A lovely and simple title for a pleasingly presented and simple photograph, the one fitting the other well.  As  tootsweet has mentioned, the condensation on the bottle is wonderful, and I feel adds an aura to the image that is so evocative of my idealised sense of homeliness.  On a technical note, I wonder if the composition would be bettered by moving the bottle slightly to the right - the flowers lean to the left, and this may make more of that feature.  I am also slightly unsure about the focus - on the green stems and leaves it is as I like it, detailed but not over sharp, but on the flower heads it does seem a little lacking in definition. A pleasing photo that I had expected to see in the top half of scores.', '2008-08-13 08:46:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4885253, 706143, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this - the two leaves intimately connected, banding together in the face of the wide open world.  I do though, feel that the water surface seems a little flat (yes, I know water surfaces generally are flat...), sort of like there is just a very thin film of water on a smooth black surface - hard to articulate, perhaps I should leave it as something doesn''t quite connect with me in regards to the water surface.  Ah, now then, I have just tilted my (work) screen towards me and see that there is more detail there than I thought... much better!<br/> <br/>edit: Just seen this is yours Deb.  I really, really like the outtake!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-13 07:56:21.</i></td>', 'I like this - the two leaves intimately connected, banding together in the face of the wide open world.  I do though, feel that the water surface seems a little flat (yes, I know water surfaces generally are flat...), sort of like there is just a very thin film of water on a smooth black surface - hard to articulate, perhaps I should leave it as something doesn''t quite connect with me in regards to the water surface.  Ah, now then, I have just tilted my (work) screen towards me and see that there is more detail there than I thought... much better! edit: Just seen this is yours Deb.  I really, really like the outtake!', '2008-08-13 08:55:30.000000', '2008-08-13 08:56:21.000000', 0),
(4885261, 706388, 67258, '<td valign="top">It''s cool the way the light catches on the little stars, and the overall blue tone works very well - I would never have thought to play with the white balance to acheive such an effect - very creative.  On a minor  compositional note, I do wish the metal bars weren''t visible - perhaps part of a plant holder - as I do feel they detract somewhat from the overall effect.</td>', 'It''s cool the way the light catches on the little stars, and the overall blue tone works very well - I would never have thought to play with the white balance to acheive such an effect - very creative.  On a minor  compositional note, I do wish the metal bars weren''t visible - perhaps part of a plant holder - as I do feel they detract somewhat from the overall effect.', '2008-08-13 09:05:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4885313, 706456, 28896, '<td valign="top">Great shot! As always! I was wondering, do they like it??? They don´t look happy! Congrats!</td>', 'Great shot! As always! I was wondering, do they like it??? They don´t look happy! Congrats!', '2008-08-13 09:48:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4885552, 706460, 44877, '<td valign="top">This just cracked me up when I first saw it - Die Dumpty! What a kick!! Great idea.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This just cracked me up when I first saw it - Die Dumpty! What a kick!! Great idea. ', '2008-08-13 11:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
