(4885809, 705725, 67551, '<td valign="top">The two in this series are just brilliant. Awesome. Guggenheim-worthy, in my unqualified opinion.<br/> <br/>My only reservation is that for some reason, I feel strongly that in "The Re-Training," the fallen flying girl should also be borrowing the umbrella and holding it opened in her free hand, trying to add a "Mary Poppins" to her host of other unsuccessful attempts to re-attain the skies.<br/> <br/>Anyway, brilliant work.</td>', 'The two in this series are just brilliant. Awesome. Guggenheim-worthy, in my unqualified opinion. My only reservation is that for some reason, I feel strongly that in "The Re-Training," the fallen flying girl should also be borrowing the umbrella and holding it opened in her free hand, trying to add a "Mary Poppins" to her host of other unsuccessful attempts to re-attain the skies. Anyway, brilliant work.', '2008-08-13 13:19:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4886749, 706456, 75532, '<td valign="top">congratulations on the ribbon!<br/></td>', 'congratulations on the ribbon!', '2008-08-13 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4886814, 706308, 29011, '<td valign="top">Didn''t know you had something for the challenge and was pleasantly surprised to see this while browsing the thumbs during the voting phase. Really like the PP here and glad it scored well. The shot''s mood comes across well.</td>', 'Didn''t know you had something for the challenge and was pleasantly surprised to see this while browsing the thumbs during the voting phase. Really like the PP here and glad it scored well. The shot''s mood comes across well.', '2008-08-13 18:59:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4886817, 705725, 29011, '<td valign="top">Wonderful to see the continuation of your story. Waiting to see more :)<br/> <br/>The mood was more grimm in the first, more mysterious might be a better word. Here it''s more upbeat, they befriended eachother already. For the final I imagine seeing rays coming in between the clouds as the angel makes its way up.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-13 18:01:57.</i></td>', 'Wonderful to see the continuation of your story. Waiting to see more :) The mood was more grimm in the first, more mysterious might be a better word. Here it''s more upbeat, they befriended eachother already. For the final I imagine seeing rays coming in between the clouds as the angel makes its way up.', '2008-08-13 19:00:28.000000', '2008-08-13 19:01:57.000000', 0),
