(5569366, 704436, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is a very emotive and heart-touching image. Well done regardless of whatever recpetion it garnered in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very emotive and heart-touching image. Well done regardless of whatever recpetion it garnered in the challenge.', '2009-07-12 15:58:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5572500, 704436, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great photo. But the placement of the hands sorta weirds me out... what is that in the background...armpit or other joint? The right hand holding the bird should be a left hand...<br/>I take it you had somebody else holding the bird than the background model. That''s my only issue. The muted lighting works perfectly and sets the mood nicely.</td>', 'Great photo. But the placement of the hands sorta weirds me out... what is that in the background...armpit or other joint? The right hand holding the bird should be a left hand...I take it you had somebody else holding the bird than the background model. That''s my only issue. The muted lighting works perfectly and sets the mood nicely.', '2009-07-14 07:45:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5572517, 705991, 93565, '<td valign="top">What is hurting you the most in this photo is the expression on your face, IMO. I know (personally) how hard it is to do handstands and especially one handed handstands by one''s self, but your strained expression surely detracts from the thought. Perhaps a bit of light on your left side would have helped too. Good job going solo on this though, I''ve tried capturing photos of me dirt jumping and know how much of a headache it can be.</td>', 'What is hurting you the most in this photo is the expression on your face, IMO. I know (personally) how hard it is to do handstands and especially one handed handstands by one''s self, but your strained expression surely detracts from the thought. Perhaps a bit of light on your left side would have helped too. Good job going solo on this though, I''ve tried capturing photos of me dirt jumping and know how much of a headache it can be.', '2009-07-14 08:03:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5577716, 705991, 91663, '<td valign="top">Funny you should say that, spatula--the handstand itself wasn''t hard--I actually took a few shots in which I had a more deadpan expression--but I figured that dangling from the earth <i>would</i> be, and grimaced for what I felt to be comic effect.</td>', 'Funny you should say that, spatula--the handstand itself wasn''t hard--I actually took a few shots in which I had a more deadpan expression--but I figured that dangling from the earth would be, and grimaced for what I felt to be comic effect.', '2009-07-17 16:44:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5578888, 705939, 99263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and very tastefully done.</td>', 'Beautiful and very tastefully done.', '2009-07-19 07:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5617537, 705510, 67579, '<td valign="top">NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!<br/> <br/>*the Canadian faints*<br/> <br/>cool photo Judi, but next time use something more colourfull and useless like wine :P</td>', 'NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO! *the Canadian faints* cool photo Judi, but next time use something more colourfull and useless like wine :P', '2009-08-19 20:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7243848, 706347, 23484, '<td valign="top">The processing is absolutely outstanding. You really have a way of making things pop.</td>', 'The processing is absolutely outstanding. You really have a way of making things pop.', '2014-07-24 14:27:40.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
